  "description": "MCP server for MarkItUp (https://markitup.app) — AI-powered image annotation and marketing-visual generation. Lets Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Cursor, ChatGPT-with-MCP, and other MCP-compatible clients call\n  MarkItUp directly. Powered by Claude analysis + Gemini image generation.\n\n  ## Tools (5)\n\n  - **markitup_credit_balance** — check credits + subscription status (free)\n  - **markitup_generate** — create 3 marketing-visual variations from any image (1 credit)\n  - **markitup_regen** — regenerate one variation from a previous call (1 credit)\n  - **markitup_extend** — AI outpainting for aspect-ratio changes (1 credit)\n  - **markitup_remove_background** — HD background removal via Photoroom (1 credit)\n\n  Get your API key at https://markitup.app/dashboard/.",
